{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚解释了眼前亲近的安慰暂时退去、余温仍在，于是独处的快乐与无法被完全陪同的孤单并存，也区分了身体松动和牵挂未解这两个原因；但对第40小节为何此刻发生转折、心紧如何起落，以及他怎样调整对暂时没有回应的理解来改变感受，交代得较为概括。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把前段退开、时间流逝使快乐显出将成过去、对对方心意的不确定引出酸楚与心紧，以及不把暂时无回应等同拒绝从而重新回到温柔的机制串联起来，也分别解释了低声脆弱和更贴身的沉浸两种听法；但部分因果依赖未在文本中释义的H/M编号，而且时间感等心理推断不能单凭听感证实。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙在保留甲版核心因果的同时，更具体地解释了此刻的转折、情绪反复的触发条件，以及应对方式如何阻止不确定感持续升级，因此即使部分推断仍需保留，也没有形成足以判为实质退步的缺口。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "59ff0ddc-4872-4541-8a4d-68d89801c961", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133611368069Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:37:05.252757+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4ad274cd3a1275975989e747949911d1cd5df0f9dc6ae16ae214ef39d6374d23", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat